WEBVTT

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.671
every year for a number of years.

00:08:30.695 --> 00:08:32.576
There was a spike a few years before,

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.442
but that wasn't actually Queensland.

00:08:34.466 --> 00:08:36.097
Anyone know where that was?

00:08:36.121 --> 00:08:37.742
Wasn't Port Arthur, no.

00:08:37.766 --> 00:08:39.844
Victoria? Yes, correct.

00:08:39.868 --> 00:08:41.845
That spike was all Victoria.

00:08:41.869 --> 00:08:43.020
(Laughter)

00:08:43.044 --> 00:08:45.608
So it wasn't that Queensland
had a particular problem

00:08:45.632 --> 00:08:48.327
with deaths from police
shootings and so on.

00:08:48.351 --> 00:08:50.764
So, six shootings
across the whole country,

00:08:50.788 --> 00:08:52.825
fairly consistently over the years before.

00:08:52.849 --> 00:08:55.801
The next two years were the years
they studied -- 2001, 2002.

00:08:55.825 --> 00:08:58.737
Anyone want to take a stab
at the number of times,

00:08:58.761 --> 00:09:00.417
given how they've introduced this,